Here are a few quick examples to get you started using the `dashboard-shift` API:

**Fetching the latest feed updates (first page):**

```typescript
async function getLatestUpdates() {
  const updates = await client.get({ page: 1 });
  if (updates && updates.data) {
    console.log("Latest updates:", updates.data);
  } else {
    console.error("Failed to fetch updates.");
  }
  return updates;
}
```

**Fetching updates with a specific page number:**

```typescript
async function getUpdatesForPage(pageNumber: number) {
  const updates = await client.get({ page: pageNumber });
  if (updates && updates.data) {
    console.log(`Updates for page ${pageNumber}:`, updates.data);
  } else {
    console.error(`Failed to fetch updates for page ${pageNumber}.`);
  }
  return updates;
}
```

